notes = "(!) FMT_SYS.ROM (md5): feaf8c5675151e00cfe3ad27673bff29|(!) FMT_DOS.ROM (md5): 0585b19930d4a7f4c71bcc8a33746588|(!) FMT_FNT.ROM (md5): eb44f2093f51eb7159f03e170b13af76|(!) FMT_DIC.ROM (md5): 34847786d7de94b5d1133c956ab1d75d|These are the FM Towns Model 1/2 ROMs; file names are accepted in any case (fmt_sys.rom...).|Place the ROMs in system/geartowns/, in a subfolder such as system/geartowns/fmtowns/, or as the MAME set system/geartowns/fmtowns.zip; system/ is searched the same way as a fallback.|Each set is recognized by its system ROM; modified or unknown ROMs also load, with a warning.|FMT_F20.ROM is optional; a blank ROM is used if it is missing.|The FM Towns II UX needs its own set (MAME fmtownsux), in system/geartowns/fmtownsux/ or as system/geartowns/fmtownsux.zip.|Free FM Towns Project replacement ROMs are also supported."

description = "A port of the Geartowns Fujitsu FM Towns emulator to libretro. This core emulates the FM Towns Model 1/2 and the FM Towns II UX with CD-ROM and floppy disk drives, disc swapping, gamepads, mouse and keyboard."
